# Raw run data (JSONL, JFR, logs: hundreds of MB per run) stays local; report.py regenerates
# everything from it. Commit only the summary, its charts, the PDF brief, the tables and the
# run manifest.
/*/**
!/*/
!/*/SUMMARY.md
!/*/manifest.json
!/*/charts/
!/*/charts/*.png
!/*/report/
!/*/report/report.pdf
!/*/report/data/
!/*/report/data/*.csv
